  "body": "What changed: one helper, `pick_button` / `pick_widget` in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/pick_button.rs`, styles every Pick button. An armed pick has the selection fill and a stroke. An idle pick has a faint tint of the same colour. The boundary Pick, the setup pick rows, the WCS pick rows, the locate button and the tool-body picks use it. The change has no effect on behaviour or commands.\n\nTests: `armed_and_idle_fills_differ` and `an_armed_pick_button_reads_as_toggled_on_and_an_idle_one_as_off` (structural, no pixels). `cargo xtask gate quick` is green. Clippy on `camcraft-ui` is clean.\n\nNot exercised: no agent can launch the GUI, so before and after screenshots are owed. The maintainer or a reviewer must add them. The Geometry page Pick rows are not changed here, because issue 1726 changes them.\n\nChangelog: Pick buttons have one style, with a clear armed state (#1728, PR #1747)\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #1728\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
